# Place GGUF model files here
#
# Required models:
# - specialists/*.gguf - Small (<1B) models for specialist swarm
# - gpt-oss-20b-trendyol-Q4.gguf - Big Momma model (3-20B)
#
# Recommended models:
# - Big Momma: https://huggingface.co/mradermacher/gpt-oss-20b-trendyol-instruct-data-i1-GGUF
# - Alternative: https://huggingface.co/fdtn-ai/Foundation-Sec-8B
#
# Specialists will be fine-tuned from smaller models like:
# - TinyLlama
# - Phi-2
# - Qwen-0.5B
